# aildb -- a local, file-based vector search engine.
#
# The entry point of the one executable: it will read the command
# (build, search or check) and be the only place that prints and exits;
# the functions of src/lib/ return what they found. No command is
# written yet, so the program ends with status 0 whatever it is given.
use "lib/std/io.aiw"
